{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22395","headline":"村居卧病三首 三 · 白居易","name":"村居卧病三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种黍三十亩，雨来苗渐大。\n种薤二十畦，秋来欲堪刈。\n望黍作冬酒，留薤爲春菜。\n荒村百物无，待此养衰瘵。\n葺庐备阴雨，补褐防寒岁。\n病身知几时，且作明年计。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}